### ============================================================
### 26-Caffeine In-Memory Cache API Testing (Port: 8126)
### ============================================================

### 1. Tạo sản phẩm mới
POST http://localhost:8126/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Gaming Keyboard",
  "price": 99.99
}

### 2. Lấy sản phẩm qua Spring Cache Abstraction (@Cacheable)
GET http://localhost:8126/api/products/spring/1
Accept: application/json

### 3. Lấy sản phẩm qua Manual Cache (Cache<K,V>)
GET http://localhost:8126/api/products/manual/1
Accept: application/json

### 4. Lấy sản phẩm qua LoadingCache (tự động load khi miss)
GET http://localhost:8126/api/products/loading/1
Accept: application/json

### 5. Lấy sản phẩm qua AsyncLoadingCache (CompletableFuture)
GET http://localhost:8126/api/products/async/1
Accept: application/json

### 6. Xóa cache thủ công
DELETE http://localhost:8126/api/products/manual/1

### 7. Xem thống kê Cache (Hit rate, Miss rate, Eviction count)
GET http://localhost:8126/api/products/manual/stats
Accept: text/plain
